  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to ensure sustainable protection of Palestinian digital rights and to ensure that the policies and practices of the Palestinian Authority (PA) and private companies in Palestine are in line with human rights law and norms.</narrative>
